```sh
terraform plan -var-file=envs/prod.tfvars
export TF_VAR_db_password=$(aws secretsmanager get-secret-value ...)
```
Precedence (pastdan yuqoriga): env `TF_VAR_` < `terraform.tfvars` < `*.auto.tfvars` < `-var`/`-var-file` (buyruq qatorida).

33326.a:
```hcl
locals {
  name = "${var.project}-${var.env}"
  tags = { project = var.project, env = var.env, managed_by = "terraform" }
}

resource "aws_s3_bucket" "logs" {
  bucket = "${local.name}-logs"
  tags   = local.tags
}

output "bucket_name" { value = aws_s3_bucket.logs.bucket }
output "db_password" { value = random_password.db.result  sensitive = true }
```
`depends_on` — masalan IAM policy biriktirilishini kutish kerak, lekin atributga murojaat yo'q. Ko'p ishlatilsa — dizayn noaniq belgisi; avval implicit reference qidiring.
Provider darajasida `default_tags` — hamma resursga tag avtomatik.

33328.a:
```hcl
data "aws_caller_identity" "current" {}
data "aws_vpc" "shared" { tags = { Name = "shared-prod" } }
data "aws_subnets" "private" {
  filter { name = "vpc-id" values = [data.aws_vpc.shared.id] }
  tags = { tier = "private" }
}

resource "aws_instance" "app" {
  subnet_id = data.aws_subnets.private.ids[0]
}
```
Gotcha: `most_recent = true` AMI data source — yangi AMI chiqqanda plan instance'ni **replace** qiladi. Prod'da AMI ID'ni pin qiling yoki `ignore_changes = [ami]`.
